<? echo $text_normal ?>
If you've found a bug in one of our products, we'd like to know so we can quash it mercilessly. Just let us know using our <A HREF="http://fenris.lokigames.com/">bug report and support form</A>.
<? echo $_text_normal ?>

<? echo $subhead ?>
General support
<? echo $_subhead ?>

<? echo $text_small ?>
For general support and troubleshooting questions, see the product and technical support FAQs. Please be sure to apply the latest patch for your software before requesting technical support.
<? echo $_text_small ?>

